    {
      "id": "msg_0344_R10R0201_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "Manager: My beloved generator!\r",
        "Keep pumping the electricity out to\n",
        "provide a pleasant life for Kanto!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0344_R10R0201_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "We’ll have to beef up our security\n",
        "presence so something like this will\f",
        "never happen again!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0344_R10R0201_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "The generator’s up and running.\n",
        "It’s making electricity to spare."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0344_R10R0201_00006",
      "en_US": "The generator’s running again!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0344_R10R0201_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "Since the generator’s been fixed, the\n",
        "Manager has been cheerful."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0344_R10R0201_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "All right! We can finally get the\n",
        "Magnet Train running again."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0344_R10R0201_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "I collect Pokémon.\n",
        "Do you have a Quagsire?\r",
        "Want to trade it for my Porygon2?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0344_R10R0201_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "Yay! I got myself a Quagsire!\n",
        "Thanks!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0344_R10R0201_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "Huh? That’s not Quagsire.\n",
        "What a letdown..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0344_R10R0201_00012",
      "en_US": "You don’t want to trade? Aww..."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0344_R10R0201_00013",
      "en_US": "Hi, how’s my old Porygon2 doing?"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0344_R10R0201_00014",
      "en_US": [
        "Staff Mottos:\r",
        "1. Electricity is not infinite.\n",
        "2. Conserve wherever possible.\f",
        "3. Watch out for each other.\f",
        "4. Idle hands are not allowed.\f",
        "5. Wear shoes with rubber soles.\f",
        "6. The Manager is awesome."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0344_R10R0201_00015",
      "en_US": [
        "Use electricity wisely\n",
        "for a bright and pleasant life.\f",
        "           Kanto Power Plant"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0344_R10R0201_00016",
      "en_US": [
        "Pokémon magazines!\r",
        "Pokémon Pal...\n",
        "Pokémon Handbook...\r",
        "Adorable Pokémon...\r",
        "Hm? There appears to be\n",
        "something between the books...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0344_R10R0201_00017",
      "en_US": [
        "Pokémon magazines!\r",
        "Pokémon Pal...\n",
        "Pokémon Handbook...\r",
        "Adorable Pokémon..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0344_R10R0201_00018",
      "en_US": [
        "After the conclusion of the trade, a\n",
        "mysterious sphere appeared in midair...\r"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
